---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/marketing/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/marketing/Footer.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<Layout title="Partner Program - DocFoundry.app" description="Earn recurring revenue by helping teams automate their document workflows with DocFoundry.app">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
          <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-slate-100 mb-4">
              DocFoundry.app Partner Program
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
              Earn recurring revenue by helping teams automate their document workflows.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">
              Every company deals with messy PDFs, invoices, contracts, receipts, shipping docs, and scanned forms. DocFoundry.app turns that chaos into clean JSON, CSV, and Excel — and you can earn monthly income by recommending it.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12">
              Whether you're a developer, automation consultant, agency, or content creator, this program lets you earn <strong>recurring commissions</strong> for every customer you bring in.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6">Why promote DocFoundry.app?</h2>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">High demand</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Every SaaS team, accountant, logistics operator, or business owner wants to eliminate manual data entry. DocFoundry.app solves a painful, universal problem.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Recurring commissions</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Earn up to <strong>30% recurring revenue for 12 months</strong> for each paying customer you refer. If they stay, you continue earning — simple.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Built for automation</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Your audience uses Make.com, Zapier, n8n, Airtable, Google Sheets, and custom APIs. DocFoundry.app becomes the engine that extracts their data. You look like the hero.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Developer-first</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Clean API, predictable responses, fast OCR, template engine, AI extraction. This is an easy product to integrate and to sell through tutorials, videos, and client projects.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6">How commissions work</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12 ml-4">
              <li><strong>30% recurring for 12 months</strong> on all paid plans</li>
              <li>Earn on initial subscription + renewals + upgrades</li>
              <li>Commissions clear after a short verification period</li>
              <li>Payouts via PayPal / Wise</li>
              <li>Minimum payout threshold: €50</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12">
              Your only job: send people who need automated data extraction.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6">What you'll get as a partner</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Unique affiliate links</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Track clicks, signups, and conversions directly in your dashboard.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Optional coupon codes</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  Perfect for YouTube, newsletters, LinkedIn posts, or client recommendations.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Real-time analytics</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  See everything: total clicks, new signups, paying customers, earned commissions, and pending/cleared payouts.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Promo materials & templates</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  We give you ready-to-use visual assets, feature descriptions, email templates, social media copy, and automation workflow examples.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6">Who is this for?</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-4">
              This program is perfect for:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12 ml-4">
              <li>Devs who build tools, bots, and APIs</li>
              <li>Automation experts (Make.com, n8n, Zapier)</li>
              <li>SaaS founders & indie hackers</li>
              <li>Bookkeeping & ERP integrators</li>
              <li>Freelancers & digital agencies</li>
              <li>AI workflow creators / YouTubers</li>
              <li>Bloggers & technical writers</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12">
              If your audience or clients handle documents, you can earn from day one.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6">Use cases your audience will love</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12 ml-4">
              <li>Invoice → JSON → CRM / ERP</li>
              <li>Purchase orders → CSV</li>
              <li>Contracts → structured fields</li>
              <li>Shipping docs → Excel</li>
              <li>Expense receipts → automated entry</li>
              <li>PDF → AI → structured data</li>
              <li>Bulk extraction for accounting & logistics</li>
              <li>Full automation pipelines with webhooks</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12">
              DocFoundry.app integrates everywhere. That makes it easy to recommend in tutorials, templates, and client projects.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6">Examples of how partners earn</h2>
            <div class="space-y-6 mb-12">
              <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">A Make.com YouTuber</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2">
                  Creates a tutorial: "Automate invoice processing with DocFoundry.app + Make.com"
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  → 40 trials → 15 paid → recurring €350/month earnings.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">A dev agency</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2">
                  Uses DocFoundry.app in client projects for data pipelines.
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  → Recommends it to 10 clients → ~€600/month recurring.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">A blogger</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-2">
                  Writes an article: "Top 5 tools for automating PDF extraction"
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                  → 5–10 signups/month.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12 italic">
              You don't even need a big audience — you need the <em>right</em> audience.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-12 mb-6">How to join</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-4">
              Joining takes less than a minute.
            </p>
            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8 ml-4">
              <li>Apply using the button below</li>
              <li>Get approved</li>
              <li>Receive your affiliate dashboard</li>
              <li>Share your link and start earning</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-12">
              We're looking for long-term partners. If you understand automation, AI, SaaS, or workflow design — we'd love to work with you.
            </p>

            <div class="text-center mt-16 mb-12">
              <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-4">Ready to earn?</h2>
              <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">
                Earn recurring revenue by helping companies eliminate manual data entry forever.
              </p>
              <Button href="/register?ref=partner" variant="primary" class="px-8 py-4 text-lg">
                Join the Partner Program
              </Button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

